MODULE: ThrottledNeverRefusesPaceRefuses
TARGET: ThrottledNeverRefuses
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: throttled pacing is replaced with a refusal
PERTURBS: Pace

--- FIND
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.pace = GateValue = 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: throttling is refusal rather than pacing.
    /\ consumer' = [consumer EXCEPT !.pace = FALSE,
        !.writer = IF GateValue = 1 THEN "refused" ELSE @]
--- END
